--- !u!114 &8147305279328663042
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7785960561895106196}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6055b615e083d274e8c210729ddbc39d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCInteraction
  dialogueSteps:
  - dialogueLines:
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Calm down dude...
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: So the main thing you'll be doing out there is stocking the shelves.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Over there on the table is my punch card...
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Picking it up will come naturally to you.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Once you've picked it up, take it over to the punch card machine.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Place it down the exact same way you picked it up.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Come back and speak to me once you're done.
  - dialogueLines:
    - speakerName: Johnny
      sentence: Okay, I did it...
    - speakerName: Johnny
      sentence: These muffins are way too strong.
    - speakerName: Johnny
      sentence: It feels like someone is controlling me.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: They have that effect. Now lock in dude.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Go over to that egg stack over there and pick up some eggs.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Once again it will come naturally to you.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Throw some eggs at the picture of the boss.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Come back to me when you're done.
  - dialogueLines:
    - speakerName: Johnny
      sentence: I'm done, but why did you make me do that?
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: It's going to get overwhelming out there.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: If a customer gets in the way of you doing your job...
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Throw an egg at them.
    - speakerName: Johnny
      sentence: WHAT?!
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: 'You can hold 3 dozen eggs. '
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: '12 in your hand, 24 in your reserves. Make sure you don''t run out. '
    - speakerName: Johnny
      sentence: You're gonna get me fired!
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: That's why you're gonna have to be conservative with it.
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: If you piss enough customers off and they all leave the store...
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: Who knows what Boss will do...
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: 'Anyway man, I think you''re ready to tackle the shift.  '
    - speakerName: Jerry
      sentence: 'When you''re prepared, leave the breakroom and meet me out there. '
  interactionPrompt: talk.
